_0029>.\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\nAssume <MATH_0030> is annihilated by a prime number <MATH_0031>.\nChoose an injective resolution <MATH_0032>\nin <MATH_0033>. Applying assumption\n(2) and Leray's acyclicity lemma\n(Derived Categories, Lemma <REF_0003>)\nwe see that\n<MATH_0034>\ncomputes <MATH_0035>. We conclude by applying\nLemma <REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8cd82bef951fc4af806532dd36e9a21ffeaba2008753054a9fbc3d6dfacfab0c", "unit_id": "tag:0A4B:proof"}
